;    0: TWdCondition(count=1061, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=965, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\歪むカオ.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村家車.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>There was a strange air over the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> gone missing, had this year's curse-killing already happened?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That unease had become an invisible fog, blanketing the settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Only <STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE> was at home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally she'd greet us with one of her goofy impressions, but this time, it seemed, she couldn't.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Kana</STYLE> were apparently both out walking around, searching for <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tomorrow the thirteenth-year memorial goes ahead as planned, they say, but the air already called for words like 'mourning' and 'grief'.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, how about it? Sense anything?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"No. There was a big cherry tree in the garden, but it looks like it's almost dead."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Just like </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> said..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, where's the storehouse </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> was doing her research in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey now, you're going already? We could rest a bit first..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"I just want to take a quick look at the storehouse. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Otherwise I'll be too worried about </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> to sit still..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"All right. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, you stay here. Nobody else knows we're sniffing around the curse-killings. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">If too many of us go poking around, they'll get suspicious."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Y-yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> nodded, looking uneasy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> is <STYLE ID="8">Necro</STYLE>'s target.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment she's on her own, just like <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>...<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Actually, let's all three of us go. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Showing only </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> around the settlement out of nowhere would be weird anyway!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Y-yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> gave the same response as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe that was a bit of a tactless thing to say...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"You two go. My intuition doesn't work here, and I'm no use to anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> might be able to tell me all sorts of things if I talk with her, too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">There are three of us, so why not split up the work?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was certainly efficient, but I could see a hint of loneliness on <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi's</STYLE> face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"So I'll head downstairs. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Obaasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> looked like she was getting dinner ready, so I'll go help."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... here, I don't have any power at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So let me do what I can."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
With that, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> left the room.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Did I say something wrong after all...? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">―I went and said something that would leave her all alone..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"It's fine. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is just a little on edge too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Let's check the storehouse quickly and hurry back to her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yeah, you're right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was a little worn out from the long trip here, but with this heavy atmosphere, I couldn't bring myself to rest easy.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------